This flagship case outlines an end-to-end, cloud-native and AI-enabled platform designed to accelerate 
fibre penetration, reduce cost-to-serve and materially improve customer experience in a competitive 
and price-sensitive telecommunications market.
The case demonstrates how AI can be deployed selectively and responsibly across the fibre value chain
— from acquisition and network investment planning to servicing and retention — 
while maintaining cost discipline and regulatory compliance.
